        "content": "## Live SEC Form D Startup Funding & IRC 409A Lead Tracker\n\nExtracts newly funded private-placement operating companies from live SEC EDGAR Form D XML filings with CEO/CFO signer contact, phone number, closed dollars, IRC Sec. 409A revaluation triggers, and 57-state corporate tax nexus.\n\n**1/ Instant Zero-Key Run:** Click **Test workflow** right away \u2014 runs in keyless preview mode out of the box.\n**2/ Full 100-Lead Pro Batches:** Get a free RapidAPI key at https://rapidapi.com/quantledger/api/quantledger-73-engine-financial-and-statutory-api or install `n8n-nodes-quantledger`."
